{"seq":2,"slug":"demand-forecasting","title":"需求预测：时间序列、季节性与事件驱动峰值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/fundamentals/demand-forecasting","wordCount":1776,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"需求预测-时间序列-季节性与事件驱动峰值\">需求预测：时间序列、季节性与事件驱动峰值</h1><p>容量规划的准确性取决于对未来负载的预测质量。<strong>需求预测</strong>将历史流量数据转化为对未来负载的定量估算，让工程师在峰值到来之前提前准备资源，而不是事后救火。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>STL 分解</td>\n<td>将时间序列分解为趋势（Trend）、季节性（Seasonal）和残差（Residual）三部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>季节性</td>\n<td>以固定周期重复出现的流量波动（日/周/年）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>峰值因子</td>\n<td>峰值流量与平均流量的比值，衡量流量波动幅度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Headroom</td>\n<td>在预测峰值之上额外预留的容量缓冲，用于吸收预测误差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MAPE</td>\n<td>平均绝对百分比误差，衡量预测模型的准确度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prophet</td>\n<td>Meta 开源的时间序列预测库，自动处理季节性和趋势变化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"流量的三种模式\">流量的三种模式</h2><p>理解流量的构成是需求预测的起点。实际系统的流量通常由三类成分叠加而成：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 流量分解&#10;        A[实际流量] --&gt; B[趋势成分\\n长期增长/下降]&#10;        A --&gt; C[季节性成分\\n周期性波动]&#10;        A --&gt; D[残差/事件成分\\n促销/发布/突发]&#10;    end&#10;    B --&gt; E[预测模型输入]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; F[事件峰值预案]&#10;    E --&gt; G[容量目标]&#10;    F --&gt; G\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 流量分解\n        A[实际流量] --&gt; B[趋势成分\\n长期增长/下降]\n        A --&gt; C[季节性成分\\n周期性波动]\n        A --&gt; D[残差/事件成分\\n促销/发布/突发]\n    end\n    B --&gt; E[预测模型输入]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; F[事件峰值预案]\n    E --&gt; G[容量目标]\n    F --&gt; G</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成分</th>\n<th>周期</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>处理方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>趋势</td>\n<td>月/季/年</td>\n<td>用户增长导致基线 QPS 每月增加 5%</td>\n<td>线性/指数回归</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>季节性</td>\n<td>日/周/年</td>\n<td>工作日流量是周末的 3 倍；双十一是日常的 10 倍</td>\n<td>分解法（STL）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件驱动</td>\n<td>不规律</td>\n<td>新功能发布、营销活动、突发新闻</td>\n<td>标注历史事件，单独建模</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"时间序列分析基础\">时间序列分析基础</h2><h3 id=\"stl-分解-seasonal-trend-decomposition-using-loess\">STL 分解（Seasonal-Trend decomposition using LOESS）</h3><p>STL 是处理时间序列季节性的工业标准方法，将时间序列分解为三个加法成分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_t = T_t + S_t + R_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>T_t（Trend）</strong>：长期趋势</li>\n<li><strong>S_t（Seasonal）</strong>：季节性成分</li>\n<li><strong>R_t（Residual）</strong>：残差（不可预测部分）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from statsmodels.tsa.seasonal import STL&#10;import pandas as pd&#10;&#10;# 加载每小时 QPS 数据（至少 2 个完整周期）&#10;df = pd.read_csv(&quot;qps_hourly.csv&quot;, index_col=&quot;timestamp&quot;, parse_dates=True)&#10;qps = df[&quot;qps&quot;]&#10;&#10;# STL 分解：周期 = 24×7 = 168 小时（一周）&#10;stl = STL(qps, period=168, robust=True)&#10;result = stl.fit()&#10;&#10;trend = result.trend      # 长期趋势&#10;seasonal = result.seasonal  # 季节性&#10;residual = result.resid   # 残差&#10;&#10;# 季节性峰值因子：用于确定 headroom&#10;peak_factor = (seasonal.max() - seasonal.min()) / trend.mean()&#10;print(f&quot;季节性峰谷比: {peak_factor:.2f}x&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statsmodels.tsa.seasonal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> STL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 加载每小时 QPS 数据（至少 2 个完整周期）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.read_csv(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"qps_hourly.csv\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">index_col</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"timestamp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">parse_dates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">qps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> df[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"qps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># STL 分解：周期 = 24×7 = 168 小时（一周）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stl </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> STL(qps, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">period</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">168</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">robust</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stl.fit()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">trend </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.trend      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 长期趋势</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">seasonal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.seasonal  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 季节性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">residual </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.resid   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 残差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 季节性峰值因子：用于确定 headroom</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">peak_factor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (seasonal.max() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seasonal.min()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trend.mean()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"季节性峰谷比: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">peak_factor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">x\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"sarima-模型\">SARIMA 模型</h3><p>对于有明确季节性的流量，<strong>SARIMA（Seasonal ARIMA）</strong> 模型在短期预测（1~4 周）中表现优异：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SARIMA</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>D</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SARIMA}(p, d, q)(P, D, Q)_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SARIMA</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>参数含义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(p, d, q)</strong>：非季节性 ARIMA 阶数（自回归、差分、移动平均）</li>\n<li><strong>(P, D, Q)</strong>：季节性 ARIMA 阶数</li>\n<li><strong>s</strong>：季节周期（如 168 表示每周一个周期的小时数据）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>实际工程中的简化</strong>：大多数平台工程师不需要手动调参，可以使用 <strong>Prophet</strong>（Meta 开源）或云厂商的预测服务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from prophet import Prophet&#10;import pandas as pd&#10;&#10;# Prophet 要求列名为 ds（时间戳）和 y（值）&#10;df = pd.DataFrame({&quot;ds&quot;: timestamps, &quot;y&quot;: qps_values})&#10;&#10;model = Prophet(&#10;    yearly_seasonality=True,&#10;    weekly_seasonality=True,&#10;    daily_seasonality=True,&#10;    changepoint_prior_scale=0.05  # 趋势变化灵敏度&#10;)&#10;model.fit(df)&#10;&#10;# 预测未来 30 天&#10;future = model.make_future_dataframe(periods=30*24, freq=&quot;H&quot;)&#10;forecast = model.predict(future)&#10;&#10;# 取预测上界作为容量规划基准（80% 置信区间上界）&#10;capacity_target = forecast[&quot;yhat_upper&quot;].tail(30*24).max()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prophet </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Prophet</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Prophet 要求列名为 ds（时间戳）和 y（值）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.DataFrame({</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: timestamps, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: qps_values})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Prophet(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    yearly_seasonality</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    weekly_seasonality</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    daily_seasonality</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    changepoint_prior_scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 趋势变化灵敏度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.fit(df)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 预测未来 30 天</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">future </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.make_future_dataframe(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">periods</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">freq</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"H\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">forecast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.predict(future)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 取预测上界作为容量规划基准（80% 置信区间上界）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">capacity_target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> forecast[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"yhat_upper\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].tail(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).max()</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"峰值因子与-headroom-设计\">峰值因子与 Headroom 设计</h2><h3 id=\"峰值因子-peak-factor\">峰值因子（Peak Factor）</h3><p>峰值因子是峰值流量与平均流量的比值，是容量规划的关键输入：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>业务类型</th>\n<th>典型峰值因子</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ToC 娱乐/游戏</td>\n<td>5~15x</td>\n<td>晚高峰和节假日流量远高于日均</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ToB SaaS</td>\n<td>2~4x</td>\n<td>工作时段明显，周末低谷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电商</td>\n<td>20~100x</td>\n<td>大促期间极端峰值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金融交易</td>\n<td>3~8x</td>\n<td>开盘/收盘时段集中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容分发（CDN）</td>\n<td>2~5x</td>\n<td>热点内容引发突发流量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>计算方法</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"峰值因子 = P99_1min(流量) / AVG_7d(流量)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>峰值因子 = P99_1min(流量) / AVG_7d(流量)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>不用瞬时最大值（容易被异常数据影响），而用 P99 一分钟聚合值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"headroom-策略\">Headroom 策略</h3><p><strong>Headroom</strong> 是在峰值预测之上额外预留的容量缓冲，用于吸收预测误差和意外流量：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[历史最大峰值 P_max] --&gt; B[乘以增长系数\\nP_max × 1.3 年增长]&#10;    B --&gt; C[加上预测误差缓冲\\n× 1.2]&#10;    C --&gt; D[设为容量目标\\n= 规划容量]&#10;    D --&gt; E[实际资源配置\\n= 容量目标 / 目标利用率 0.7]\">flowchart TD\n    A[历史最大峰值 P_max] --&gt; B[乘以增长系数\\nP_max × 1.3 年增长]\n    B --&gt; C[加上预测误差缓冲\\n× 1.2]\n    C --&gt; D[设为容量目标\\n= 规划容量]\n    D --&gt; E[实际资源配置\\n= 容量目标 / 目标利用率 0.7]</pre><p><strong>公式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>资源配置</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mtext>增长系数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>误差缓冲</mtext></mrow><mtext>目标利用率</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{资源配置} = \\frac{P_{max} \\times \\text{增长系数} \\times \\text{误差缓冲}}{\\text{目标利用率}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">资源配置</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目标利用率</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">增长系数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">误差缓冲</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>典型参数：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>增长系数：1.2~1.5（对应 20%~50% 的预期增长）</li>\n<li>误差缓冲：1.1~1.3</li>\n<li>目标利用率：0.6~0.75（CPU/内存）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"事件驱动峰值的预案\">事件驱动峰值的预案</h2><p>常规时间序列模型无法处理<strong>计划外事件</strong>（病毒式传播、突发新闻）和<strong>计划内事件</strong>（大促、新版本发布）。这两类需要不同的处理策略。</p>\n<h3 id=\"计划内事件的流量预估\">计划内事件的流量预估</h3><p><strong>大促/营销活动预估方法</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[历史同类活动数据] --&gt; B[计算基准倍率\\n大促/普通日均]&#10;    B --&gt; C[乘以当前基线\\n× 增长系数]&#10;    C --&gt; D[活动峰值预测]&#10;    D --&gt; E[资源预扩容计划\\n活动前 N 小时完成]\">flowchart LR\n    A[历史同类活动数据] --&gt; B[计算基准倍率\\n大促/普通日均]\n    B --&gt; C[乘以当前基线\\n× 增长系数]\n    C --&gt; D[活动峰值预测]\n    D --&gt; E[资源预扩容计划\\n活动前 N 小时完成]</pre><p><strong>分阶段峰值模型</strong>（以电商大促为例）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>时间点</th>\n<th>预估倍率</th>\n<th>处置措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预热期</td>\n<td>T-24h</td>\n<td>3x 日均</td>\n<td>扩容至 50% 大促容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开门红</td>\n<td>T+0 ~ T+30min</td>\n<td>50x 日均</td>\n<td>最大容量，所有降级开关就绪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续期</td>\n<td>T+1h ~ T+12h</td>\n<td>15x 日均</td>\n<td>维持高容量，逐步回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收尾期</td>\n<td>T+12h ~ T+24h</td>\n<td>5x 日均</td>\n<td>缩容至 30% 大促容量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"计划外突发的快速响应\">计划外突发的快速响应</h3><p>对于无法预测的突发流量，关键是<strong>反应速度</strong>而非预测精度：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>流量感知时间</strong>：从流量开始飙升到告警触发，目标 ≤ 1 分钟</li>\n<li><strong>扩容决策时间</strong>：从告警到下发扩容指令，目标 ≤ 2 分钟（自动）</li>\n<li><strong>扩容生效时间</strong>：从指令下发到新实例接流，取决于平台，EC2 约 3~5 分钟，容器约 30 秒</li>\n</ol>\n<p>在扩容生效前，系统需要依赖<strong>降级策略</strong>（限流、熔断、缓存优先）撑过空窗期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预测模型的选择与评估\">预测模型的选择与评估</h2><h3 id=\"模型选型矩阵\">模型选型矩阵</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐模型</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强季节性，稳定增长</td>\n<td>Prophet</td>\n<td>自动处理季节性，鲁棒性好</td>\n<td>对突变反应迟钝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短期高精度（1~7天）</td>\n<td>SARIMA</td>\n<td>统计严谨，可解释性好</td>\n<td>需要人工调参</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超短期（1~4小时）</td>\n<td>指数平滑</td>\n<td>实时性强，计算轻量</td>\n<td>无法捕获季节性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长期战略规划（半年+）</td>\n<td>线性/指数增长 + 历史峰值因子</td>\n<td>简单直观，领导易理解</td>\n<td>忽略季节性细节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多维度特征（节假日、活动）</td>\n<td>LightGBM/XGBoost</td>\n<td>特征工程灵活</td>\n<td>需要较多历史数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"预测精度评估\">预测精度评估</h3><p>使用<strong>MAPE（Mean Absolute Percentage Error）</strong> 评估预测模型精度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MAPE</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MAPE} = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{t=1}^{n}\\left|\\frac{A_t - F_t}{A_t}\\right| \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAPE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9185em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>容量规划场景的精度目标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MAPE ≤ 10%：优秀，可以减少 headroom</li>\n<li>MAPE 10%~20%：良好，保留标准 headroom</li>\n<li>MAPE &gt; 20%：需要增加 headroom 或改进模型</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"需求预测的数据基础\">需求预测的数据基础</h2><p>好的预测依赖好的数据。数据收集的最佳实践：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>最小保留周期</th>\n<th>采样间隔</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>QPS / RPS</td>\n<td>2 年</td>\n<td>1 分钟</td>\n<td>趋势分析、峰值因子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P50/P99 延迟</td>\n<td>1 年</td>\n<td>1 分钟</td>\n<td>性能基线建立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU / 内存利用率</td>\n<td>1 年</td>\n<td>1 分钟</td>\n<td>资源效率趋势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大促/活动标注</td>\n<td>全历史</td>\n<td>事件级</td>\n<td>活动预估模板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>告警触发记录</td>\n<td>2 年</td>\n<td>事件级</td>\n<td>预测误差分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键实践</strong>：为每个重大事件（大促、发布、故障）打上标注，存入时序数据库的元数据。这些标注是未来活动预估的宝贵输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>需求预测的核心是<strong>将历史流量规律转化为可操作的容量目标</strong>。对于有规律的周期性波动，STL 分解和 Prophet 是首选工具；对于不规律的事件驱动峰值，需要建立历史活动数据库，通过类比估算；对于两者的结合，保守的 headroom 设计（预测上界 × 增长系数 / 目标利用率）是应对预测误差的最后防线。预测精度不是一次性工作——持续评估 MAPE 并定期重新训练模型，是保证预测可靠性的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>上一篇：<a href=\"capacity-modeling\">容量建模方法</a>——理解系统容量的数学工具，是需求预测的配套知识</li>\n<li>下一篇：<a href=\"cost-performance-tradeoffs\">成本性能权衡</a>——在预测得到容量目标后，如何以最优成本满足该目标</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"需求预测：时间序列、季节性与事件驱动峰值","id":"需求预测-时间序列-季节性与事件驱动峰值"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"流量的三种模式","id":"流量的三种模式"},{"level":2,"text":"时间序列分析基础","id":"时间序列分析基础"},{"level":3,"text":"STL 分解（Seasonal-Trend decomposition using LOESS）","id":"stl-分解-seasonal-trend-decomposition-using-loess"},{"level":3,"text":"SARIMA 模型","id":"sarima-模型"},{"level":2,"text":"峰值因子与 Headroom 设计","id":"峰值因子与-headroom-设计"},{"level":3,"text":"峰值因子（Peak Factor）","id":"峰值因子-peak-factor"},{"level":3,"text":"Headroom 策略","id":"headroom-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"事件驱动峰值的预案","id":"事件驱动峰值的预案"},{"level":3,"text":"计划内事件的流量预估","id":"计划内事件的流量预估"},{"level":3,"text":"计划外突发的快速响应","id":"计划外突发的快速响应"},{"level":2,"text":"预测模型的选择与评估","id":"预测模型的选择与评估"},{"level":3,"text":"模型选型矩阵","id":"模型选型矩阵"},{"level":3,"text":"预测精度评估","id":"预测精度评估"},{"level":2,"text":"需求预测的数据基础","id":"需求预测的数据基础"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"容量建模方法：排队论、Little's Law 与 USL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/fundamentals/capacity-modeling"},"next":{"title":"成本性能权衡：RI、Savings Plans 与 Spot 组合策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/fundamentals/cost-performance-tradeoffs"}}